            <ArticleTitle>A unique non-interpenetrated open-framework chalcogenide with a large cavity.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>49-52</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1039/c7dt03988c</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Reported here is a unique non-interpenetrated open-framework metal chalcogenide built on a supertetrahedral [Fe4In16S35]14- cluster. The non-interpenetrated feature accompanied with the relatively large-sized cluster leads to a high extra-framework volume.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
